{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rami on Watalands</strong> is a &quot;classic&quot; open-world action-adventure game in which you are the Martian Rami,  who has come on Earth in search of the perfect souvenir for his beloved. But instead of a simple journey, you find yourself caught in the conflict between Monkeys and Pandas, uncovering ancient mysteries and facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520060/extras/b2a10523ba130be8d92f55706a1044b2.poster.avif?t=1741379100\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520060/extras/b2a10523ba130be8d92f55706a1044b2.webm?t=1741379100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520060/extras/b2a10523ba130be8d92f55706a1044b2.mp4?t=1741379100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down action-adventure in a retro 2D world torn by the monkey-panda conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world filled with enemies and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrect the villagers who have turned into pearls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520060/extras/7210f7d511fae4bbf35712481e7ebb3e.poster.avif?t=1741379100\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/